WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.730
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.460
You're really burning the midnight oil.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.830
Anna-sensei.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.250
May I stay a bit longer?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.090
Sure thing.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.090
Just don't go overboard.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:31.510
I won't.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.600
The S4 Selection is almost here.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:52.150
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.800
Mahiru!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:41.340
Rola. Good evening.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.100
Were you practicing all this time?

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:43.850
Yeah.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.100
Not much longer until the S4 Selection.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.180
That's right.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.480
Do you want to stop by my room for a bit?{a while, not awhile}

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.820
Sit tight a minute.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.450
Thanks for waiting.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.950
I made hot chocolate.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.710
And it's nonsugar, so it's okay to drink at night.{you might not understand, but this is a jokereference}

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.040
Thanks.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.550
You seem preoccupied.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:24.850
Thinking about the S4 Selection next month is making me uneasy.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.100
All my work is going well, and I'm improving every lesson. Still...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.770
It's like something's missing.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.900
I feel the same way.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:40.610
You're worried about whether you're really making any progress, right?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.610
Yeah.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.870
I know that we just need to do everything we can, but...

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.620
What exactly does that mean, I wonder.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.840
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.510
Rola, good morning.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.510
Morning.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.890
Yume, heading out for a job?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.140
Yep. I'm going to be a guest on a morning program.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.890
And they want me three days straight!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.890
Wow, that's great!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.850
I'll really try to get everyone's blood pumping.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:18.230
Though I am kind of nervous since this is a new show for me.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.360
Don't worry, you've got what it takes.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.530
Thanks!

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.650
Knock 'em dead!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.910
I will! See you later!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.410
<i>Yume's doing everything she can.</i>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.330
<i>I have to find what I can do too.</i>

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.670
Mahiru, I'm ready.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.840
Sorry to do this so early in the morning.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:40.920
You don't need to be.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.720
What did you want to ask?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:44.930
Actually...

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.180
I'm feeling a bit stuck.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.180
Let me think.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.060
All I thought about was how I could refine myself.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:02.440
I studied all I could about beauty and trained until I collapsed.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:06.030
But there's one thing more important than all that.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:11.740
You have to perform at as many shows as possible.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.790
A performance is the culmination of all your training.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.800
Lessons are important, but nothing compares to the real thing.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.260
A performance...

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.300
But at this point...

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.300
If you have no opportunities,

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.800
just make one yourself!

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.600
Huh?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:33.220
The academy lends stage time every day.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.190
That's what Yozora-senpai told you?

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:40.230
And I've been thinking...

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.480
Do you want to hold an event with me?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.440
An event?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.240
Yeah. The main stage could be a unit performance with you and me...

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.990
How's that sound? What do you think?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.910
A unit with you...

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.460
That gets me going! Let's do it!

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.000
That's what we can do right now!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.630
You're right! Let's do it together!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.510
This is great!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.510
I'm all for your idea! Yay!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.760
Unfortunately...

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:15.390
The school's stages are completely booked.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.680
Oh no...

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.560
Look.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.150
And it was such a good idea.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.030
There are no openings...

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.650
Huh? Sensei, I have a question.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.360
What's this maintenance in three days?

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.700
Oh, they periodically check the 
machinery and repair the equipment.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.500
We'll help them with their work!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.790
Oh! Please let us use the time we can shave off!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.800
Even a single song would be enough, so please!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.800
Let us at least try!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.800
Babies...

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.800
We should be able to procure half an hour.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:58.060
If you're set on doing it, 
I'll put in a request with the staff.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.060
What do you say?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.730
Half an hour is more than enough!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.360
Thank you so much!

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:09.320
You have my gratitude for your assistance.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:13.320
Those two are more similar than they seem.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.750
I expect them to invigorate one another.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:24.540
Yes. It'll be exciting to see what kind of chemical reaction the powerhouses of Song and Beauty Classes create.{this line was kinda... big}

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.090
You're holding an event? That's awesome!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:34.390
There's not much time, but I'm confident we'll be able to pull it off.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.010
We'll have to make sure we keep up.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:37.850
Yeah!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.270
I'll support you in any way I can.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.520
We can help with advertising or anything else. Right?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:47.610
I must refuse. Unlike you, I'm rather busy.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.400
Great! You're in charge of handing out flyers then.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.450
What?!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:56.120
Both of you have helped me out so much before.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.200
I want to do something in return.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.500
Yume.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:04.750
Oh, if you insist. I suppose I can spare some of my precious time.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.790
Thanks, you two!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.170
We'll give this a hundred and ten percent!

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.260
Yeah!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:13.470
By the way, have you decided what song you're using?

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:16.260
No, not yet.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.850
We want a song that'll get people up on 
their feet, but it's hard to nail one down.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.140
So a fun song...

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.020
Huh?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.400
Ako-chan?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.530
She's over there?

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.450
Ako-chan, what're you looking at?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.410
Flowers!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.370
They're crocuses.{I would've pegged you for a croci guy}

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.660
Crocuses?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.170
I saw something in the corner of my eye and had to check.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.090
They're growing naturally, too.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.920
What cute buds.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.420
In flower language, they represent "joy of youth".

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.930
I love them.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.100
That's a nice meaning.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.180
Spring is right around the corner.

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.930
Right as soon as these buds open. {it needs something}

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.310
Spring...

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.690
I've got it! How about Honeybee Kiss?{ganbanbe odoru mitsubachi}{ganbabe?}

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:11.860
For your song! It's really cute and cheery.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.690
Speaking of honeybees...

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:19.950
I've heard that they begin their activities anew around now, just as winter ends.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.410
You mean just like what we're doing, right?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.750
That's poetic.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.630
Okay, we'll go with that!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:30.590
This is all so wonderful! I'm feeling fired up too!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.170
Come on, let's make this an awesome event!

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.010
Yeah!

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.340
Of course!

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.970
Yes!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:39.600
Yay!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.730
These turned out quite nice!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:45.980
Didn't they?

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.810
Let's go hand them out.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.390
Yeah, I'm feeling it!

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:28.730
Me too. Let's wrap it up now so we're ready for tomorrow.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.690
Sure, good work.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:40.410
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:48.790
Snow?

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.140
Come in.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.140
Morning, Rola.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:13.560
Good morning. Looks like the trains and buses are still running.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:17.070
Yeah. Our event should be able to start right on schedule.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.070
Wait up!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.620
Catch me if you c—

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.830
Bring it on!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.580
I won't lose!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.040
Just look at them play. They're such children.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.920
Just try and get me!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:33.960
Hey!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.340
Isn't that a good thing?

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.880
Try this on for size!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.550
Guess so.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.840
I love it.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:40.840
Huh?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.840
Your relationship with Yume.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.600
Where'd that come from?

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:50.230
There's only one spot in S4, but you both encourage each other in your Aikatsu.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:53.650
Watching you two fills me with determination.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.860
Mahiru...

00:11:56.270 --> 00:12:03.530
I want not just to be driven by my sister, but also to drive her forward as well.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.620
Seeing you two like this only makes that feeling stronger.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:12.620
If you told Yume that, she'd probably break down in tears of joy.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:16.210
Up we go.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:18.380
Hey!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.380
Heya!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:24.640
Oh! Ako-chan, Ako-chan! 
Wouldn't it be cute if we added glasses?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:28.760
To be honest, after losing over and over to Yume, I got so frustrated I couldn't think straight.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.390
Yes, what a lovely idea!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.680
But Aikatsu isn't about winning or losing.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:37.520
As long as you follow your own shining path, it will eventually lead to a future in S4.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:43.820
I say that over and over, but what keeps me going is Yume.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.660
The only thing I can say to my rival Yume are words of gratitude.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.910
I hope you can tell her that one day.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.830
No way, it's too embarrassing.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.630
Though I guess I could tell her once I make S4.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.670
Looks like your work's cut out for you.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:04.680
Today's event is one more step towards your goal.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:05.510
You got it.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.600
Start the equipment check.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.180
Okay! Front lights look good! {doesn't say light but it also isn't consequential}

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.770
That looks like hard work.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.150
Thank you for everything.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.810
Hey, no problem.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:22.690
We apologize for causing you all this much trouble.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.280
Is there anything we could do to help you?

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:27.950
Don't worry about it, we're totally fine.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:32.950
We're ahead of schedule, so rest assured that we'll make it in time for your event.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.290
Thank you.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:38.210
We brought a little something for everyone to enjoy.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:41.460
They're nothing fancy, but we made sour konbu rice balls.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.590
We also have warm drinks.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.840
Wow, for us?

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:45.970
Thanks!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.720
Here you are.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.470
I hope you get a big crowd.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.760
Thanks!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.810
I'm so grateful to all the staff.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.060
Yeah, and to Tamagorou-sensei too.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.730
Are you okay?

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:04.070
Y-Yeah, thanks.

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:07.570
You have to be extra careful when the pathways are covered in snow.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.030
Yeah, it's really dangerous.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.580
I know!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.460
This is the road our fans will take.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.460
We can't make them trudge through this snow!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.920
Let's make a path all the way to the theater!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:25.710
Right!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.810
Yume? Ako?

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.230
You two...

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:41.980
Rola!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.610
Mahiru!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:47.320
We figured it'd be tough for the eventgoers to get through this.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.450
Indeed.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.120
Okay, us too!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.840
Finished!

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.340
We made a path...

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.050
Thanks, girls.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.350
It's fine, shoveling was fun.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:16.810
All that remains is for you to put on the greatest show you can.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.310
We've got that covered. Right?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.810
Of course! Just watch us.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:22.980
We will.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.820
An event with Rola-chan and Mahiru-chan has got to be interesting.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.200
Ossu! {I almost regret not doing this from the start. feel free to do whatever}{this}

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:55.600
Thank you all so much for braving the snow to come see us.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:59.640
We'll heat you up so much it'll melt all the snow away!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.520
Rola and...

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:04.100
Mahiru's special event!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.610
Start!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.510
We've reached the end of our program.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:35.510
It may still be cold outside, but we'd like you to feel the warmth of spring through this song.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:38.390
We would now like to present...

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.390
Our first unit stage! Please enjoy!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.400
My heart feels so warm and fuzzy.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.690
Mine too.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.620
The whole audience had a smile on their faces the entire time.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.200
Yeah, and even being modest...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.200
It was a huge success!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.290
Isn't this...

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.210
Yume got one just the other day.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.800
It's a special Grade-up Glitter!

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:43.470
Congratulations!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.510
Thank you.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:51.430
Is it true that I can make a special dress unique to me if I use this Glitter?{whatever as long as we get all the words}

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.480
Yep, you've got it right.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:58.480
It will make a one-of-a-kind dress that's all your own.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.990
There's no dress more fit to be worn for the S4 Selection.{???}

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:08.160
Make yourselves a dress that'll bring out all your luster.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.120
Okay!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:26.470
This is my own personal dress, the Aqua Starry Rock Coord!

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:31.430
My dress is the Exotic Sunset Coord!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.940
I made the Lovely Rainbow Dream Coord. {can you even stuff more idol-y words into this one?}{there might be idolier words, but nay many}

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.690
The rainbow accents are super cute!

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:44.190
With this dress, I know I'll make S4!

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:47.700
I feel like I'll shine brighter than ever with it!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.450
This is it. All we can do now is run full steam ahead...{both speed and steam are use, but I may this more here}

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.210
Ako-chan?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:03.210
I will have my own special Glitter before you know it!

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:07.970
I may be a step behind, but it won't be for long!

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:09.680
Ako-chan...

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:10.550
Right.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.630
Dress GET!{fine, only because I like this thing}

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:16.350
All I need is a big performance!

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.220
Ako-chan, you can do it!

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:20.270
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.270 --> 00:24:22.020
Headlong Ako.

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.150
Become the first-star idol!
